# Docker
.docker/

# Local-only symlinks: the real files are poetry-project.toml/.lock (kept
# under those names deliberately so Vercel's build doesn't auto-detect a
# Poetry project — see commit d96404c). These symlinks let local `poetry`/
# Docker tooling, which hard-require the standard filenames, find them
# without ever touching what's actually committed/deployed.
/pyproject.toml
/poetry.lock
